#4302
A Tidal Cave~
   A cave hollowed out of the island by the sea.  Green light comes in
with the waves from somewhere to the east, and the walls glitter with
wet shells.  A rope ladder, half rotten, hangs down a cleft in the rock
to the north, and the crawlspace beneath the brig opens to the west.
~
