#4304
The Fort Courtyard~
   The courtyard of an old stone fort that the pirates have patched with
ship's timbers and sailcloth.  A flag with a black wake on a red field
snaps from a mast above the gate.  Barrels, nets and stolen cargo are
heaped everywhere, and a bonfire smokes in a ring of stones.  The mess
hall is north, the battlements west, and a stout door to the east is
marked with a painted padlock.  Steps lead down south to the brig, and a
cleft in the rock drops away below.
~
