#4306
The Quartermaster's Store~
   A long storeroom stacked with everything the Pirate King has ever taken:
bolts of silk, casks of wine, crates of candles, a harp, a ship's
figurehead of a mermaid, chests and chests and chests.  Prisoners'
belongings are kept here too, each lot locked in a sea chest with a name
chalked on the lid, until the ransom is paid.  The door to the courtyard
is west.
~
