#4307
The Mess Hall~
   A long hall with trestle tables, benches, a cold hearth and the
remains of a feast.  Bottles roll underfoot.  Hooks along the wall hold
cloaks, cutlasses and a ring of keys.  A curtained doorway leads north to
the captain's quarters, and the courtyard is south.
~
