#4308
The Battlements~
   The crumbling west wall of the fort, with old cannon rusting in their
ports and a sentry walk along the top.  The sea is everywhere below, and
far to the north a smudge on the horizon might be the coast.  A path runs
off the end of the wall and along the cliffs to the west.  The courtyard
is east.
~
