#4309
The Pirate King's Cabin~
   The captain's quarters, made from the stern cabin of some captured
galleon and set into the fort like a jewel in a skull.  Stained glass
windows, a carved bed, a desk covered in charts, a map of the coast with
pins in it for every ship he has taken.  It is empty, and in a hurry: a
chair is overturned and a cloak is gone from its hook.  The mess hall is
south.
~
