#4312
The Lamp Room~
   The top of the lighthouse, open to the sky where the glass has long
since gone.  The great iron lamp is cold.  From up here you can see the
whole island, the fort, the cove and the endless sea - and anyone coming
up the cliff path.  The stair goes down.
~
