#4313
The Hidden Cove~
   A little cove of white sand hidden between two arms of black rock, so
that no ship at sea would ever see it.  The pirates' longboats are
dragged up on the beach, and one of them is in the water, its oars
shipped, bobbing at the end of a rope.  The tidal cave is west.
~
