#4314
In a Pirate Longboat~
   You sit in a pirate longboat with the oars in your hands.  The island is
behind you, and ahead, far off to the north, is the smudge of the coast
and the stilt-legged docks of Vice Island.  It is a long, hard row.  You
could go back to the cove to the west, or pull east and north for the
mainland and freedom.
~
